000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. AIDPAYRN.
000300 AUTHOR. SCHOOL-FINANCE.
000400*----------------------------------------------------------------
000500* MONTHLY STATE AID PAYMENT RUN - SYNTHETIC TEST PROGRAM
000600* READS DISTRICT ENTITLEMENTS, APPLIES ADJUSTMENTS AND HOLDBACK,
000700* WRITES PAYMENT RECORDS AND A CONTROL REPORT.
000800*----------------------------------------------------------------
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001100 SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
001200 OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
001300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001400 FILE-CONTROL.
001500     SELECT ENTITLE-FILE ASSIGN TO ENTIN
001600         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
001700         FILE STATUS IS WS-ENT-STATUS.
001800     SELECT ADJUST-FILE ASSIGN TO ADJIN
001900         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002000         FILE STATUS IS WS-ADJ-STATUS.
002100     SELECT PAYMENT-FILE ASSIGN TO PAYOUT
002200         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002300         FILE STATUS IS WS-PAY-STATUS.
002400     SELECT REPORT-FILE ASSIGN TO RPTOUT
002500         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
002600 DATA DIVISION.
002700 FILE SECTION.
002800 FD  ENTITLE-FILE
002900     RECORDING MODE IS F.
003000 01  ENTITLE-REC.
003100     05  ENT-DISTRICT-ID         PIC X(6).
003200     05  ENT-DISTRICT-NAME       PIC X(30).
003300     05  ENT-FISCAL-YEAR         PIC 9(4).
003400     05  ENT-BASE-AMOUNT         PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
003500     05  ENT-PUPIL-UNITS         PIC S9(7)V999 COMP-3.
003600     05  FILLER                  PIC X(10).
003700 FD  ADJUST-FILE
003800     RECORDING MODE IS F.
003900 01  ADJUST-REC.
004000     05  ADJ-DISTRICT-ID         PIC X(6).
004100     05  ADJ-TYPE                PIC X(2).
004200         88  ADJ-PRIOR-YEAR      VALUE 'PY'.
004300         88  ADJ-LEVY-EQUAL      VALUE 'LE'.
004400         88  ADJ-AUDIT           VALUE 'AU'.
004500     05  ADJ-AMOUNT              PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
004600     05  FILLER                  PIC X(20).
004700 FD  PAYMENT-FILE
004800     RECORDING MODE IS F.
004900 01  PAYMENT-REC.
005000     05  PAY-DISTRICT-ID         PIC X(6).
005100     05  PAY-PERIOD              PIC 9(6).
005200     05  PAY-GROSS               PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
005300     05  PAY-HOLDBACK            PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
005400     05  PAY-NET                 PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
005500     05  FILLER                  PIC X(12).
005600 FD  REPORT-FILE
005700     RECORDING MODE IS F.
005800 01  REPORT-LINE                 PIC X(132).
005900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
006000 01  WS-FILE-STATUSES.
006100     05  WS-ENT-STATUS           PIC XX VALUE '00'.
006200     05  WS-ADJ-STATUS           PIC XX VALUE '00'.
006300     05  WS-PAY-STATUS           PIC XX VALUE '00'.
006400 01  WS-SWITCHES.
006500     05  WS-ENT-EOF              PIC X VALUE 'N'.
006600         88  ENT-EOF             VALUE 'Y'.
006700     05  WS-ADJ-EOF              PIC X VALUE 'N'.
006800         88  ADJ-EOF             VALUE 'Y'.
006900 01  WS-CONSTANTS.
007000     05  WS-HOLDBACK-PCT         PIC V999 VALUE .100.
007100     05  WS-PAY-PERIOD           PIC 9(6) VALUE 202609.
007200 01  WS-WORK.
007300     05  WS-GROSS                PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
007400     05  WS-ADJ-TOTAL            PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
007500     05  WS-HOLDBACK             PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
007600     05  WS-NET                  PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
007700 01  WS-COUNTERS.
007800     05  WS-READ-COUNT           PIC 9(7) COMP VALUE 0.
007900     05  WS-PAID-COUNT           PIC 9(7) COMP VALUE 0.
008000     05  WS-ZERO-COUNT           PIC 9(7) COMP VALUE 0.
008100 01  WS-TOTALS.
008200     05  WS-TOTAL-GROSS          PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
008300     05  WS-TOTAL-NET            PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
008400 01  WS-REPORT-DETAIL.
008500     05  FILLER                  PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
008600     05  RD-DISTRICT-ID          PIC X(6).
008700     05  FILLER                  PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
008800     05  RD-DISTRICT-NAME        PIC X(30).
008900     05  FILLER                  PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
009000     05  RD-GROSS                PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.
009100     05  FILLER                  PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.
009200     05  RD-NET                  PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.
009300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
009400 0000-MAIN.
009500     PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
009600     PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-DISTRICT
009700         UNTIL ENT-EOF
009800     PERFORM 9000-FINALIZE
009900     STOP RUN.
010000 1000-INITIALIZE.
010100     OPEN INPUT  ENTITLE-FILE
010200                 ADJUST-FILE
010300          OUTPUT PAYMENT-FILE
010400                 REPORT-FILE
010500     IF WS-ENT-STATUS NOT = '00'
010600         DISPLAY 'AIDPAYRN: OPEN FAILED ' WS-ENT-STATUS
010700         MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
010800         STOP RUN
010900     END-IF
011000     PERFORM 8100-READ-ENTITLE
011100     PERFORM 8200-READ-ADJUST.
011200 2000-PROCESS-DISTRICT.
011300     MOVE ENT-BASE-AMOUNT TO WS-GROSS
011400     MOVE ZERO TO WS-ADJ-TOTAL
011500     PERFORM 2100-APPLY-ADJUSTMENTS
011600         UNTIL ADJ-EOF
011700            OR ADJ-DISTRICT-ID > ENT-DISTRICT-ID
011800     ADD WS-ADJ-TOTAL TO WS-GROSS
011900     IF WS-GROSS NOT > ZERO
012000         ADD 1 TO WS-ZERO-COUNT
012100     ELSE
012200         PERFORM 2200-COMPUTE-HOLDBACK
012300         PERFORM 2300-WRITE-PAYMENT
012400     END-IF
012500     PERFORM 8100-READ-ENTITLE.
012600 2100-APPLY-ADJUSTMENTS.
012700     IF ADJ-DISTRICT-ID = ENT-DISTRICT-ID
012800         EVALUATE TRUE
012900             WHEN ADJ-PRIOR-YEAR
013000                 ADD ADJ-AMOUNT TO WS-ADJ-TOTAL
013100             WHEN ADJ-LEVY-EQUAL
013200                 ADD ADJ-AMOUNT TO WS-ADJ-TOTAL
013300             WHEN ADJ-AUDIT
013400                 SUBTRACT ADJ-AMOUNT FROM WS-ADJ-TOTAL
013500             WHEN OTHER
013600                 DISPLAY 'AIDPAYRN: UNKNOWN ADJUSTMENT ' ADJ-TYPE
013700         END-EVALUATE
013800     END-IF
013900     PERFORM 8200-READ-ADJUST.
014000 2200-COMPUTE-HOLDBACK.
014100     COMPUTE WS-HOLDBACK ROUNDED = WS-GROSS * WS-HOLDBACK-PCT
014200     COMPUTE WS-NET = WS-GROSS - WS-HOLDBACK.
014300 2300-WRITE-PAYMENT.
014400     MOVE ENT-DISTRICT-ID TO PAY-DISTRICT-ID
014500     MOVE WS-PAY-PERIOD   TO PAY-PERIOD
014600     MOVE WS-GROSS        TO PAY-GROSS
014700     MOVE WS-HOLDBACK     TO PAY-HOLDBACK
014800     MOVE WS-NET          TO PAY-NET
014900     WRITE PAYMENT-REC
015000     ADD 1 TO WS-PAID-COUNT
015100     ADD WS-GROSS TO WS-TOTAL-GROSS
015200     ADD WS-NET   TO WS-TOTAL-NET
015300     MOVE ENT-DISTRICT-ID   TO RD-DISTRICT-ID
015400     MOVE ENT-DISTRICT-NAME TO RD-DISTRICT-NAME
015500     MOVE WS-GROSS          TO RD-GROSS
015600     MOVE WS-NET            TO RD-NET
015700     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-DETAIL.
015800 8100-READ-ENTITLE.
015900     READ ENTITLE-FILE
016000         AT END SET ENT-EOF TO TRUE
016100         NOT AT END ADD 1 TO WS-READ-COUNT
016200     END-READ.
016300 8200-READ-ADJUST.
016400     READ ADJUST-FILE
016500         AT END SET ADJ-EOF TO TRUE
016600     END-READ.
016700 9000-FINALIZE.
016800     DISPLAY 'AIDPAYRN: DISTRICTS READ  ' WS-READ-COUNT
016900     DISPLAY 'AIDPAYRN: PAYMENTS WRITTEN ' WS-PAID-COUNT
017000     DISPLAY 'AIDPAYRN: ZERO OR NEGATIVE ' WS-ZERO-COUNT
017100     CLOSE ENTITLE-FILE
017200           ADJUST-FILE
017300           PAYMENT-FILE
017400           REPORT-FILE.
